salloc -q interactive -C cpu --image=$IMG -t 4:00:00 -A m2043 -N 4

One time install of UoI software insise new shifetr image

Upgrade build tools inside the venv:
shifter python -m pip install -U pip setuptools wheel

Do the editable install:
shifter python -m pip install -e /global/cfs/cdirs/mpccc/balewski/2025_UoI-VAR
